# Biohub submission safety

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `reports/RECOVERY_20260831.md` before acting.
- Never submit through raw Kaggle CLI/API calls. Use the guarded helper only.
- This is a code competition: submitted code must read the runtime competition
  test set. Frozen public `submission.csv` inputs are not hidden-compatible.
- After each submission inspect `error_description`, status, score, bytes,
  receipt, URL/version, and quota. A PENDING candidate does not block another
  independently pre-registered and audited candidate.
- Stop the daily batch on any recorded error, terminal empty score, source or
  version mismatch, or other anomaly. Preserve the exact receipt and diagnose.
- Update experiment receipts before and after every external mutation.
